# 2026-10-04：目标压缩方式改变后，提交前仍应读取缓冲源中的原始内容。
description read new data before applying requested compression
arguments -n pending.zip add entry.txt "pending data\n" cat 0 set_file_compression 0 store 0 cat 0 set_file_compression 0 deflate 0 cat 0 cat_partial 0 8 5 cat 0 unchange_all
return 0
stdout
pending data
pending data
pending data
data
pending data
end-of-inline-data
